##### MycoNest  
*solo / duo* 

A dark, humidity-controlled box with hourly 0.5 ppm O₂ pulses mimics forest-floor shocks, fruiting gourmet mushrooms fast. Pop-out sleeves swap blocks in seconds.

###### Crop Categories & Cultivars  
Mushrooms & culinary fungi – all 15 Balcony strains  

